<title>UK: Kexim sets 500 mln mark FRN due 2002.</title>
<headline>Kexim sets 500 mln mark FRN due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bankx.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA EXPORT-IMPORT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  100.06    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.96</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
